1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,192 --> 00:01:55,752
=Episode 4=

21
00:01:58,180 --> 00:01:59,340
(No updates in 24 hours)
The folks in the chat

22
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:00,941
(Is Lucky Beauty Yu missing?)
ask me to check Lucky Beauty Yu.

23
00:02:00,941 --> 00:02:01,540
(Lucky Beauty Yu acting weird)

24
00:02:01,540 --> 00:02:02,540
(Baibai Liu)
They said something happened.

25
00:02:02,701 --> 00:02:03,501
Her fate unknown.

26
00:02:03,501 --> 00:02:04,980
- Her injury doesn't look accidental.
- Involving Beauty Yu too.

27
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:05,460
(Check Lucky Beauty Yu)
Really?

28
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:06,141
- It looks like...
- It's confirmed?

29
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:07,421
(That's terrifying)
Something happened to Lucky Beauty Yu.

30
00:02:07,421 --> 00:02:08,296
(Strolling Painter joined the stream)

31
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,620
(Communities discussing Lucky Beauty Yu)
Is this for real?

32
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:10,900
(Lucky Beauty Yu missing)
The boss lady is missing,

33
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:11,861
causing such a scene.

34
00:02:11,861 --> 00:02:13,141
(Heard it might be abuse)

35
00:02:13,141 --> 00:02:14,021
Not abuse, right?

36
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:22,101
Meng,

37
00:02:23,101 --> 00:02:24,780
I brought your favorite
stuffed rice cakes

38
00:02:25,541 --> 00:02:26,180
right at your

39
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,101
high school gate.

40
00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:32,261
Meng,

41
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:37,060
I promise

42
00:02:37,541 --> 00:02:39,141
I won't drink while trying to conceive.

43
00:02:39,780 --> 00:02:41,381
I swear on my life.

44
00:02:42,021 --> 00:02:42,861
- Sir.
- Meng.

45
00:02:43,581 --> 00:02:44,141
Sir,

46
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,660
how can I help you?

47
00:02:46,101 --> 00:02:46,660
Well,

48
00:02:46,780 --> 00:02:48,021
my wife is in this room.

49
00:02:48,141 --> 00:02:49,220
Could you open the door?

50
00:02:50,141 --> 00:02:51,340
Well, I'm afraid...

51
00:02:53,261 --> 00:02:53,940
My wife and I

52
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:54,740
have our calendars

53
00:02:54,821 --> 00:02:55,541
synced up.

54
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:58,541
Look.

55
00:02:59,180 --> 00:03:00,301
(7:00 PM, Anlan B&B, Room 5105, Yu Meng)
She booked this room.

56
00:03:01,581 --> 00:03:03,220
Please wait a moment. Let me check.

57
00:03:07,301 --> 00:03:08,500
Room 5105...

58
00:03:09,381 --> 00:03:10,220
It's unoccupied.

59
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:11,581
Impossible.

60
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,421
If one day,

61
00:03:31,861 --> 00:03:33,541
I disappear from the public eye,

62
00:03:35,381 --> 00:03:37,141
it must be because of my husband,

63
00:03:39,101 --> 00:03:40,101
Di Liren.

64
00:03:53,660 --> 00:03:54,541
I think I know

65
00:03:54,581 --> 00:03:56,220
what Meng's vanishing is about.

66
00:03:56,701 --> 00:03:57,381
How about

67
00:03:57,701 --> 00:03:58,780
we meet and talk?

68
00:04:01,660 --> 00:04:02,421
Where are you now?

69
00:04:02,581 --> 00:04:03,220
Be right there.

70
00:04:07,701 --> 00:04:08,340
Remember the one

71
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:09,421
who put the photos of you

72
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:10,180
and Chen Chen

73
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,141
into Meng's bouquet?

74
00:04:11,981 --> 00:04:12,701
Meng found

75
00:04:12,701 --> 00:04:14,261
she probably lives in Yujing Garden.

76
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:16,300
How do you know?

77
00:04:16,581 --> 00:04:17,621
Meng told me.

78
00:04:18,061 --> 00:04:19,501
She even sent Meng a threat,

79
00:04:19,581 --> 00:04:20,540
forcing her to divorce,

80
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,501
and demanded to meet.

81
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,300
Forcing Meng to divorce me?

82
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,621
What is she really after?

83
00:04:28,181 --> 00:04:28,900
When?

84
00:04:29,460 --> 00:04:30,860
Meng only told me yesterday.

85
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,300
She was sad and couldn't stop crying.

86
00:04:34,340 --> 00:04:35,460
I asked what her plan was.

87
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,061
She said she wanted

88
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:37,860
to stay with you,

89
00:04:38,621 --> 00:04:39,540
so she planned

90
00:04:39,581 --> 00:04:40,261
to talk it out.

91
00:04:40,741 --> 00:04:41,540
Know the exact time

92
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:42,181
and place?

93
00:04:42,821 --> 00:04:43,501
I don't.

94
00:04:43,501 --> 00:04:44,701
Meng didn't tell me.

95
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:45,780
After saying that,

96
00:04:45,821 --> 00:04:46,980
she went there alone.

97
00:04:47,581 --> 00:04:49,061
There's been no word from her since.

98
00:04:49,701 --> 00:04:51,021
If it's like you thought,

99
00:04:51,540 --> 00:04:52,220
Meng's vanishing

100
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,340
is connected to this person,

101
00:04:53,821 --> 00:04:54,621
she'll definitely

102
00:04:54,621 --> 00:04:55,381
make another move.

103
00:04:57,501 --> 00:04:58,701
Now, she's in the shadows,

104
00:04:58,780 --> 00:04:59,621
and we're exposed.

105
00:05:00,741 --> 00:05:02,181
Any move we make will backfire.

106
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:04,581
We have to wait for her to move first.

107
00:05:04,980 --> 00:05:05,821
See what she wants.

108
00:05:07,261 --> 00:05:08,420
Will that really work?

109
00:05:09,420 --> 00:05:10,460
What you suspect

110
00:05:10,621 --> 00:05:11,660
is just speculation

111
00:05:11,821 --> 00:05:12,420
without proof.

112
00:05:13,821 --> 00:05:14,821
The time Meng's been gone

113
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:15,980
doesn't qualify as a case.

114
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,941
If we leak word now,

115
00:05:19,741 --> 00:05:20,860
we'll easily tip her off,

116
00:05:22,141 --> 00:05:24,220
which could put Meng in danger.

117
00:05:26,621 --> 00:05:27,460
You have a point.

118
00:05:29,561 --> 00:05:30,220
How about this?

119
00:05:31,021 --> 00:05:31,660
I'll go check

120
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:32,860
places Meng usually visits.

121
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:34,021
Okay.

122
00:05:42,021 --> 00:05:42,701
(He's coming out)

123
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:43,340
(Follow him)

124
00:05:44,501 --> 00:05:44,980
(Liu Bai)
Okay.

125
00:05:47,021 --> 00:05:47,821
I told Di Liren

126
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:48,941
everything you said.

127
00:05:49,001 --> 00:05:49,540
As expected,

128
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,741
his face changed,

129
00:05:51,021 --> 00:05:52,220
and he rushed straight out.

130
00:05:52,741 --> 00:05:53,501
He should do

131
00:05:53,540 --> 00:05:54,381
as we said

132
00:05:54,540 --> 00:05:55,780
and question that person.

133
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,061
Let's hope so.

134
00:06:00,621 --> 00:06:01,420
But

135
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:03,340
if he really goes to see that person

136
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,941
and they compare notes,

137
00:06:05,181 --> 00:06:05,621
won't they

138
00:06:05,621 --> 00:06:06,900
realize we framed him?

139
00:06:07,381 --> 00:06:08,381
Will he suspect us?

140
00:06:11,780 --> 00:06:13,381
Since that person sent me photos

141
00:06:13,501 --> 00:06:14,621
behind Di Liren's back,

142
00:06:15,181 --> 00:06:16,540
it means

143
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:18,660
there's already a rift between them.

144
00:06:19,181 --> 00:06:20,420
There's not much trust left.

145
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,952
(Liu Bai)

146
00:07:00,621 --> 00:07:01,061
Speak.

147
00:07:02,061 --> 00:07:02,701
He got off.

148
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:03,501
Went into a house.

149
00:07:03,701 --> 00:07:04,540
I'll send you photos.

150
00:07:11,181 --> 00:07:12,460
Isn't this your parents' house?

151
00:07:14,021 --> 00:07:14,540
Liren,

152
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,741
what did Meng mean in that video?

153
00:07:17,501 --> 00:07:19,300
What does she mean, if she disappears,

154
00:07:19,581 --> 00:07:20,621
it's all because of you?

155
00:07:21,181 --> 00:07:21,941
Here's the thing.

156
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:23,181
Someone played a prank

157
00:07:23,741 --> 00:07:24,821
and sent Meng photos,

158
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:26,941
saying that I had an affair

159
00:07:27,061 --> 00:07:28,192
with my assistant Chen Chen.

160
00:07:28,581 --> 00:07:29,261
In fact,

161
00:07:29,261 --> 00:07:30,621
Chen Chen has a boyfriend.

162
00:07:31,061 --> 00:07:32,181
I introduced Meng to him.

163
00:07:32,460 --> 00:07:33,941
I thought this was behind us,

164
00:07:35,021 --> 00:07:36,501
but according to Liu Zi,

165
00:07:38,141 --> 00:07:39,141
Meng was still sulking,

166
00:07:39,542 --> 00:07:40,220
saying I didn't

167
00:07:40,220 --> 00:07:41,261
care about her feelings.

168
00:07:41,660 --> 00:07:43,141
So she claimed her vanishing

169
00:07:44,660 --> 00:07:45,540
would be my fault.

170
00:07:46,300 --> 00:07:47,181
Lizhen,

171
00:07:47,741 --> 00:07:48,860
don't get so worked up.

172
00:07:49,701 --> 00:07:50,941
After all,

173
00:07:51,581 --> 00:07:53,261
Meng got her temper

174
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:54,540
from you.

175
00:07:55,420 --> 00:07:56,581
Meng is a bit spoiled

176
00:07:56,660 --> 00:07:57,381
and dramatic,

177
00:07:57,941 --> 00:07:59,340
but she's my only daughter.

178
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:00,381
I can afford to spoil her.

179
00:08:00,746 --> 00:08:01,460
But she must have

180
00:08:01,460 --> 00:08:02,780
a reason for acting up with you.

181
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:04,300
If you had handled

182
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:05,381
workplace boundaries well

183
00:08:05,581 --> 00:08:06,821
and stopped the rumors,

184
00:08:07,340 --> 00:08:08,061
would she

185
00:08:08,061 --> 00:08:08,860
cause such a scene?

186
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,220
In the end,

187
00:08:10,621 --> 00:08:11,501
it's still your fault.

188
00:08:13,540 --> 00:08:14,141
Mom,

189
00:08:15,021 --> 00:08:15,860
you're right.

190
00:08:16,261 --> 00:08:17,100
Once I find Meng,

191
00:08:17,381 --> 00:08:18,460
I'll apologize properly

192
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:19,621
and bring her back safely.

193
00:08:20,501 --> 00:08:21,220
Please calm down.

194
00:08:28,261 --> 00:08:28,941
Liren,

195
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,021
no offense,

196
00:08:31,381 --> 00:08:33,101
but you should manage your marriage

197
00:08:33,381 --> 00:08:34,300
just as diligently

198
00:08:34,300 --> 00:08:35,621
as you do your work.

199
00:08:35,981 --> 00:08:37,420
It's an art in itself.

200
00:08:38,021 --> 00:08:39,101
You need to master it.

201
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:42,141
If you don't have enough energy,

202
00:08:42,461 --> 00:08:44,180
I can return to the company to help you.

203
00:08:44,981 --> 00:08:45,501
Dad,

204
00:08:45,940 --> 00:08:46,940
I've learned my lesson.

205
00:08:47,381 --> 00:08:49,101
From now on,
Meng will always come first.

206
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:50,141
All right.

207
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:51,780
Meng is fine now,

208
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:52,820
so you can rest easy now.

209
00:08:53,101 --> 00:08:54,540
He was worried all night

210
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:56,540
and didn't eat anything.

211
00:08:59,461 --> 00:09:00,300
That won't do.

212
00:09:01,780 --> 00:09:02,381
Ms. Hui.

213
00:09:03,540 --> 00:09:04,741
Get something to eat now.

214
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:06,381
Just a moment.

215
00:09:07,021 --> 00:09:07,580
Mr. Yu.

216
00:09:08,341 --> 00:09:09,420
Let me check the size.

217
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:10,741
It's all knitted?

218
00:09:11,621 --> 00:09:12,381
Lizhen,

219
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:13,900
when people get old,

220
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:15,580
their blood vessels just shrink.

221
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:17,261
Store-bought socks

222
00:09:17,261 --> 00:09:18,141
are too tight.

223
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:20,021
After seeing that,

224
00:09:20,101 --> 00:09:20,820
Hui volunteered,

225
00:09:20,900 --> 00:09:22,300
saying she would knit

226
00:09:22,621 --> 00:09:23,180
all my socks.

227
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:24,621
These past few days,

228
00:09:24,780 --> 00:09:26,621
worrying about Meng

229
00:09:26,621 --> 00:09:28,221
has made me restless.

230
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:29,700
It was Hui

231
00:09:30,660 --> 00:09:31,981
who kept comforting me.

232
00:09:35,501 --> 00:09:36,300
Otherwise,

233
00:09:36,381 --> 00:09:37,660
my blood pressure would've

234
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:39,141
shot through the roof.

235
00:09:43,621 --> 00:09:44,741
She's already walked away.

236
00:09:45,060 --> 00:09:45,900
Still staring?

237
00:09:49,101 --> 00:09:50,381
What are you doing?

238
00:09:50,820 --> 00:09:52,261
I'm just being grateful.

239
00:09:59,461 --> 00:10:00,180
Look at how guilty

240
00:10:00,221 --> 00:10:01,540
he looks.

241
00:10:02,420 --> 00:10:04,060
If he didn't have dirty intentions,

242
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:05,660
why did he run off?

243
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:07,141
Mom,

244
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:08,430
you're overthinking it.

245
00:10:08,981 --> 00:10:09,420
Look.

246
00:10:09,820 --> 00:10:10,180
I'll go

247
00:10:10,180 --> 00:10:11,341
give Ms. Hui a hand,

248
00:10:11,940 --> 00:10:13,461
and have her make Dad some fish soup

249
00:10:13,621 --> 00:10:14,300
to nourish him.

250
00:10:15,300 --> 00:10:15,981
Please calm down.

251
00:10:32,300 --> 00:10:32,861
Ms. Hui,

252
00:10:33,101 --> 00:10:34,300
let me wash the vegetables.

253
00:10:47,461 --> 00:10:49,141
You put those photos in the flowers?

254
00:10:52,981 --> 00:10:53,540
Why?

255
00:10:54,771 --> 00:10:56,053
In case you forget what matters.

256
00:10:57,501 --> 00:10:58,580
I'd never forget.

257
00:11:00,141 --> 00:11:00,900
Wait a bit longer.

258
00:11:02,660 --> 00:11:03,580
I've been waiting.

259
00:11:05,501 --> 00:11:06,261
So,

260
00:11:06,580 --> 00:11:07,540
where is Meng?

261
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:11,900
You think I know?

262
00:11:13,381 --> 00:11:14,420
Who told you anything?

263
00:11:16,021 --> 00:11:17,221
Liu Zi told me

264
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:18,501
Meng found out

265
00:11:18,501 --> 00:11:20,141
who put the photos in the flowers,

266
00:11:20,741 --> 00:11:21,900
went to confront her,

267
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:23,180
and then went missing.

268
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:25,021
Liu Zi is her best friend.

269
00:11:25,381 --> 00:11:26,420
They share all secrets.

270
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:30,900
Are you saying

271
00:11:31,461 --> 00:11:32,900
Yu Meng told Liu Zi to say that?

272
00:11:34,501 --> 00:11:35,501
You need to be careful.

273
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:36,940
Right after she vanished,

274
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:38,780
the internet went wild,

275
00:11:39,141 --> 00:11:40,540
insinuating that you killed her.

276
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:42,180
She's just a minor influencer.

277
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:44,222
Does she have such a huge impact?

278
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,261
Someone must be pulling the strings.

279
00:11:47,341 --> 00:11:48,461
We both need to be careful.

280
00:11:50,621 --> 00:11:51,820
Find Yu Meng, end this fast,

281
00:11:51,820 --> 00:11:52,700
and divorce her.

282
00:11:54,780 --> 00:11:56,060
If she's hiding herself from me,

283
00:11:56,461 --> 00:11:57,540
she won't be easy to find.

284
00:12:00,700 --> 00:12:01,501
Be patient.

285
00:12:02,741 --> 00:12:04,180
Find a way to make her show herself.

286
00:12:16,456 --> 00:12:17,352
(Liu Bai)

287
00:12:17,621 --> 00:12:18,101
How is it?

288
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:18,700
Sis,

289
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:20,540
since yesterday, he returned

290
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,621
from Meng's parents' house,

291
00:12:21,940 --> 00:12:22,621
he's been normal.

292
00:12:23,060 --> 00:12:23,900
He just went to work

293
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:24,900
and didn't meet

294
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:25,780
with anyone strange.

295
00:12:25,900 --> 00:12:27,021
You must have been exposed.

296
00:12:28,141 --> 00:12:28,660
I am

297
00:12:28,660 --> 00:12:29,820
one hundred percent sure

298
00:12:30,101 --> 00:12:30,540
I didn't.

299
00:12:31,820 --> 00:12:32,501
He's heading out.

300
00:12:32,501 --> 00:12:33,141
I'll follow him.

301
00:12:33,261 --> 00:12:33,741
Gotta go.

302
00:12:35,501 --> 00:12:36,141
What do we do?

303
00:12:36,180 --> 00:12:37,021
Waiting like this

304
00:12:37,021 --> 00:12:37,900
won't work.

305
00:12:38,221 --> 00:12:40,060
Jiao Xu told me before

306
00:12:40,940 --> 00:12:42,540
that value fluctuations in collectibles

307
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:43,540
are unpredictable.

308
00:12:45,021 --> 00:12:46,660
Since his only physical investment

309
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,180
right now is the art gallery,

310
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:50,621
let's start with that.

311
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:51,700
So what's your plan?

312
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:53,420
Say it in front of everyone.

313
00:12:54,341 --> 00:12:55,621
How dare your gallery

314
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:57,101
sell me this painting for 3 million?

315
00:12:57,660 --> 00:12:58,861
Not even worth 30 thousand!

316
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:00,180
Refund!

317
00:13:01,341 --> 00:13:01,900
Mr. Wang,

318
00:13:02,141 --> 00:13:04,101
artwork is non-refundable
and non-exchangeable.

319
00:13:04,540 --> 00:13:06,300
This painting isn't worth this much.

320
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:07,820
When I was abroad,

321
00:13:08,101 --> 00:13:09,141
I saw this artist's work

322
00:13:09,141 --> 00:13:09,940
go up for auction.

323
00:13:11,021 --> 00:13:12,580
The highest bid on any piece

324
00:13:12,820 --> 00:13:13,780
was 20 thousand yuan.

325
00:13:14,381 --> 00:13:15,660
In your gallery,

326
00:13:15,741 --> 00:13:17,060
you marked it up a hundred times!

327
00:13:17,820 --> 00:13:18,540
This is nothing

328
00:13:18,580 --> 00:13:19,861
but an outright scam!

329
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:21,981
Let's just go somewhere else.

330
00:13:22,180 --> 00:13:22,660
Yeah.

331
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:24,580
Everyone wants to make money,

332
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:25,940
but this is way too greedy.

333
00:13:25,940 --> 00:13:26,660
Let's go.

334
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:30,540
Mr. Wang,

335
00:13:30,780 --> 00:13:31,381
I am so sorry

336
00:13:31,461 --> 00:13:31,940
for your

337
00:13:31,940 --> 00:13:32,900
unpleasant experience.

338
00:13:33,300 --> 00:13:34,660
I heard what you said.

339
00:13:35,300 --> 00:13:37,021
Paying 3 million for a painting

340
00:13:37,461 --> 00:13:38,141
proves you're

341
00:13:38,141 --> 00:13:39,501
a collector with exquisite taste.

342
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:41,780
You must know that value fluctuates,

343
00:13:42,141 --> 00:13:43,540
but personal passion is priceless.

344
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,741
If you like it,

345
00:13:45,021 --> 00:13:46,221
then it's worth every penny.

346
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:47,141
In other words,

347
00:13:47,141 --> 00:13:48,141
if you don't like it,

348
00:13:48,341 --> 00:13:49,261
even a rare masterpiece

349
00:13:49,261 --> 00:13:49,780
would be

350
00:13:49,820 --> 00:13:50,900
totally worthless to you.

351
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:52,300
Spare me the lecture.

352
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:53,940
Since you're the manager,

353
00:13:54,381 --> 00:13:55,021
just tell me

354
00:13:55,141 --> 00:13:55,700
refund

355
00:13:55,981 --> 00:13:56,780
or not?

356
00:13:57,300 --> 00:13:57,820
I'm sorry.

357
00:13:58,261 --> 00:13:58,940
It's final.

358
00:13:59,180 --> 00:13:59,940
No refunds.

359
00:14:01,861 --> 00:14:02,501
Fine.

360
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,981
Mark my words.

361
00:14:05,341 --> 00:14:06,261
I will expose

362
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:08,021
your shady shop online.

363
00:14:08,060 --> 00:14:08,981
I'll have netizens

364
00:14:09,101 --> 00:14:10,420
tear this place apart

365
00:14:10,621 --> 00:14:11,780
down to every dirty detail.

366
00:14:12,341 --> 00:14:13,461
Your gallery

367
00:14:13,580 --> 00:14:15,420
won't make another dime.

368
00:14:15,741 --> 00:14:16,700
Just wait to shut down.

369
00:14:31,621 --> 00:14:32,381
Hello, Mr. Di.

370
00:14:34,300 --> 00:14:35,540
Let him refund the painting.

371
00:14:36,221 --> 00:14:37,660
We paid out the previous cut.

372
00:14:38,060 --> 00:14:39,461
If we issue a full refund now,

373
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:40,341
we'll lose big.

374
00:14:40,981 --> 00:14:42,341
We can't let him make a scene.

375
00:14:42,820 --> 00:14:43,780
If he finds out

376
00:14:44,021 --> 00:14:45,420
I'm the owner behind the gallery,

377
00:14:45,540 --> 00:14:46,461
it'll be even worse.

378
00:14:48,461 --> 00:14:49,300
Besides,

379
00:14:49,300 --> 00:14:50,101
It's a critical stage

380
00:14:50,101 --> 00:14:51,381
for Jiali's new product launch.

381
00:14:51,940 --> 00:14:53,580
Yu Meng's disappearance has already

382
00:14:54,021 --> 00:14:55,580
disrupted the product rollout.

383
00:14:56,221 --> 00:14:57,580
We can't afford any more problems.

384
00:14:57,700 --> 00:14:58,580
But the gallery

385
00:14:58,580 --> 00:14:59,341
is out of funds.

386
00:14:59,861 --> 00:15:00,741
I'll handle it.

387
00:15:01,461 --> 00:15:01,981
Besides,

388
00:15:02,900 --> 00:15:04,461
check who referred him.

389
00:15:05,180 --> 00:15:06,141
Blacklist them.

390
00:15:06,700 --> 00:15:07,141
Okay.

391
00:15:13,461 --> 00:15:14,221
Mr. Long,

392
00:15:15,021 --> 00:15:15,700
I'd like to turn

393
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:16,461
my 3 million deposit

394
00:15:16,461 --> 00:15:17,540
from February

395
00:15:17,660 --> 00:15:18,461
into a check.

396
00:15:19,624 --> 00:15:22,184
(Bank)

397
00:15:37,501 --> 00:15:38,741
Exposing Di Liren's gallery,

398
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:40,461
pushing buyers to demand their rights,

399
00:15:40,900 --> 00:15:41,660
forcing Di Liren

400
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:42,660
to use his slush fund.

401
00:15:42,981 --> 00:15:43,420
Seriously,

402
00:15:43,580 --> 00:15:44,741
you really know your stuff.

403
00:15:44,900 --> 00:15:45,580
For all the money

404
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:46,741
he took from me,

405
00:15:47,060 --> 00:15:48,780
I'll make him pay back in full.

406
00:15:50,221 --> 00:15:51,180
That's 3 million!

407
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:53,141
He took it all

408
00:15:53,420 --> 00:15:54,501
without hesitation.

409
00:15:55,660 --> 00:15:56,820
Look on the bright side.

410
00:15:57,221 --> 00:15:58,381
Moving such a large sum

411
00:15:58,461 --> 00:15:59,741
must cause internal friction.

412
00:16:00,021 --> 00:16:00,820
Let's see if we can

413
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:01,981
lure out the big fish

414
00:16:01,981 --> 00:16:02,580
behind him.

415
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:04,101
Come on.

416
00:16:05,101 --> 00:16:05,900
You're right.

417
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,940
I'll take Di Liren down

418
00:16:08,461 --> 00:16:09,261
in one go.

419
00:16:12,101 --> 00:16:12,861
Let me take this.

420
00:16:21,461 --> 00:16:22,861
Since the check was canceled,

421
00:16:23,381 --> 00:16:24,621
you should tell me immediately!

422
00:16:25,180 --> 00:16:25,700
Sorry.

423
00:16:28,660 --> 00:16:29,501
Great!

424
00:16:30,861 --> 00:16:31,501
Bullseye!

425
00:16:42,101 --> 00:16:43,060
You canceled my check?

426
00:16:43,501 --> 00:16:44,700
That is our check.

427
00:16:47,141 --> 00:16:48,900
Something happened at the gallery.

428
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:50,300
(Recording)
Someone demanded a refund.

429
00:16:50,820 --> 00:16:51,540
I figured

430
00:16:51,981 --> 00:16:52,981
I'd just pay him off

431
00:16:53,381 --> 00:16:54,381
before he makes a scene

432
00:16:54,420 --> 00:16:55,660
and drags me into it.

433
00:16:56,141 --> 00:16:56,780
Gallery shares

434
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:57,621
are nominee-held,

435
00:16:58,180 --> 00:16:58,660
and you're

436
00:16:58,660 --> 00:16:59,621
not the legal rep.

437
00:17:00,261 --> 00:17:01,060
Regular disputes

438
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:01,940
won't lead to you.

439
00:17:02,861 --> 00:17:04,021
The gallery has to stay open.

440
00:17:04,901 --> 00:17:05,901
I just closed a deal

441
00:17:05,901 --> 00:17:06,580
a few days ago.

442
00:17:07,021 --> 00:17:08,661
We'll definitely make more
in the future.

443
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:10,461
I want to secure our future

444
00:17:10,461 --> 00:17:11,340
a bit more.

445
00:17:11,901 --> 00:17:12,981
What we have now is enough.

446
00:17:13,140 --> 00:17:14,421
I want to give you the best.

447
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:15,701
I'm not that greedy.

448
00:17:16,461 --> 00:17:17,261
I'm content.

449
00:17:17,661 --> 00:17:19,140
So now you think I'm greedy?

450
00:17:19,340 --> 00:17:20,421
I think your ambition

451
00:17:20,981 --> 00:17:22,380
goes far beyond what you claimed.

452
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:25,340
Are you actually soft on her?

453
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:26,981
For you,

454
00:17:27,540 --> 00:17:29,221
I never let her get pregnant.

455
00:17:29,780 --> 00:17:31,261
Doesn't that speak for my heart?

456
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:34,501
Didn't we agree before

457
00:17:34,820 --> 00:17:35,981
that we're in this together?

458
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:37,380
Besides,

459
00:17:38,100 --> 00:17:39,741
my money will be cleared soon.

460
00:17:40,300 --> 00:17:41,300
(Recording)
When the time comes, I'll return

461
00:17:41,300 --> 00:17:42,780
the 3 million with full interest.

462
00:17:43,421 --> 00:17:44,221
I promise

463
00:17:44,540 --> 00:17:46,421
my commitments to you won't change.

464
00:17:47,261 --> 00:17:48,661
I found an overseas institution.

465
00:17:48,981 --> 00:17:49,941
The money's transferred.

466
00:17:51,261 --> 00:17:52,981
A minor gallery issue is nothing to you.

467
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:54,661
I believe in you.

468
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:11,261
Mr. Zhou,

469
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:13,221
any extra cash lately?

470
00:18:13,941 --> 00:18:15,060
Lend me some for cash flow.

471
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:20,860
For you,

472
00:18:21,221 --> 00:18:22,981
I never let her get pregnant.

473
00:18:23,501 --> 00:18:24,901
Doesn't that speak for my heart?

474
00:18:31,060 --> 00:18:31,901
So that means

475
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:34,300
all the medication I took,

476
00:18:34,860 --> 00:18:35,580
all the suffering

477
00:18:36,461 --> 00:18:37,140
and injections

478
00:18:37,620 --> 00:18:38,540
were all for nothing?

479
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:39,860
Yes.

480
00:18:40,941 --> 00:18:42,261
I suffered so much.

481
00:18:42,981 --> 00:18:43,661
I always thought

482
00:18:43,741 --> 00:18:45,021
it was a health issue on my end.

483
00:18:45,221 --> 00:18:45,780
Turns out

484
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:46,701
he put on an act!

485
00:18:47,181 --> 00:18:47,661
Yes.

486
00:18:50,701 --> 00:18:51,941
Well done, Di Liren.

487
00:18:53,261 --> 00:18:54,540
That's truly vicious.

488
00:18:56,981 --> 00:18:58,261
From the sound of their voices,

489
00:18:59,181 --> 00:19:00,540
that woman was jealous, right?

490
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,221
Exactly.

491
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:16,580
Just cry.

492
00:19:16,820 --> 00:19:17,741
Cry my foot!

493
00:19:19,221 --> 00:19:20,140
I'm not crying.

494
00:19:21,501 --> 00:19:22,941
Di Liren is shameless.

495
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:24,340
He hid it so well.

496
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:26,261
Just you wait.

497
00:19:26,723 --> 00:19:27,540
One should put trash

498
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:28,580
into the trash can,

499
00:19:28,901 --> 00:19:29,501
not study

500
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:30,701
how the trash can works.

501
00:19:33,901 --> 00:19:34,461
Exactly.

502
00:19:35,340 --> 00:19:35,901
You're right.

503
00:19:40,741 --> 00:19:41,860
Di Liren gave me this

504
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:42,981
for our first anniversary.

505
00:19:43,300 --> 00:19:43,877
Throw it away.

506
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:46,100
Are you crazy?

507
00:19:46,981 --> 00:19:47,661
Why throw away

508
00:19:47,661 --> 00:19:48,580
something so expensive?

509
00:19:50,701 --> 00:19:51,780
Since he's transferred

510
00:19:52,181 --> 00:19:53,140
all our

511
00:19:53,140 --> 00:19:53,901
marital assets,

512
00:19:55,021 --> 00:19:55,941
sell it for me.

513
00:19:56,580 --> 00:19:57,540
I need some cash.

514
00:19:57,820 --> 00:19:59,300
I don't offer that service.

515
00:20:04,261 --> 00:20:04,741
Fine.

516
00:20:08,461 --> 00:20:09,300
(Jiao Xu)
Bangle sold.

517
00:20:09,580 --> 00:20:10,461
Money transferred.

518
00:20:12,461 --> 00:20:12,941
(Okay.)

519
00:20:13,221 --> 00:20:14,060
(Insurance covered.)

520
00:20:16,380 --> 00:20:17,661
(Jiao Xu)
Plus your livestream income,

521
00:20:17,780 --> 00:20:19,300
you can finally support yourself.

522
00:20:19,461 --> 00:20:20,421
Why not go shopping

523
00:20:20,501 --> 00:20:21,100
to celebrate?

524
00:20:32,421 --> 00:20:32,901
Hello?

525
00:20:33,060 --> 00:20:33,701
Mr. Jiao,

526
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:35,100
you are enjoying

527
00:20:35,140 --> 00:20:36,181
my misery,

528
00:20:36,181 --> 00:20:36,820
aren't you?

529
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:39,021
I'm cutting expenses here.

530
00:20:39,221 --> 00:20:40,261
Go shopping?

531
00:20:40,261 --> 00:20:41,021
My goal right now

532
00:20:41,021 --> 00:20:42,060
is catching that cheater.

533
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:42,941
And tennis.

534
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:45,580
I know your tennis coach.

535
00:20:45,701 --> 00:20:46,181
My client

536
00:20:46,181 --> 00:20:47,221
is also training with him.

537
00:20:47,461 --> 00:20:49,221
National certification,
900 yuan a session,

538
00:20:49,461 --> 00:20:49,901
right?

539
00:20:50,340 --> 00:20:51,060
Oh, right!

540
00:20:51,741 --> 00:20:52,620
I have tennis lessons

541
00:20:52,661 --> 00:20:53,261
to be refunded.

542
00:20:54,300 --> 00:20:55,100
I charged that much

543
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:56,461
only because of him.

544
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:58,620
Forget about him.

545
00:20:59,140 --> 00:20:59,620
Bad luck.

546
00:21:00,181 --> 00:21:00,780
I need to go.

547
00:21:05,501 --> 00:21:06,224
Morning, Mr. Jiao.

548
00:21:13,663 --> 00:21:14,580
You're the only client

549
00:21:14,701 --> 00:21:15,300
who always

550
00:21:15,340 --> 00:21:16,461
arrives earlier than me.

551
00:21:17,580 --> 00:21:18,901
That's because I'm more anxious

552
00:21:18,901 --> 00:21:19,620
than anyone else.

553
00:21:21,221 --> 00:21:21,860
Tell me.

554
00:21:22,501 --> 00:21:23,221
What's the plan?

555
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,380
Before we talk business,

556
00:21:26,021 --> 00:21:26,941
let me bribe

557
00:21:26,941 --> 00:21:28,340
my divorce attorney.

558
00:21:29,901 --> 00:21:30,901
A little gift for you.

559
00:21:34,261 --> 00:21:35,540
This diffuser smells amazing.

560
00:21:35,981 --> 00:21:37,620
It's soothing and calming.

561
00:21:39,060 --> 00:21:39,860
Besides,

562
00:21:39,981 --> 00:21:41,060
I buy their seasonal drop

563
00:21:41,060 --> 00:21:41,981
every year.

564
00:21:42,421 --> 00:21:43,181
You should try it.

565
00:21:47,221 --> 00:21:49,181
I hate spending money on things

566
00:21:49,501 --> 00:21:50,941
that just burn away.

567
00:21:51,820 --> 00:21:53,221
That's why your taste

568
00:21:53,221 --> 00:21:54,261
needs an upgrade.

569
00:21:55,140 --> 00:21:56,941
Then start

570
00:21:56,941 --> 00:21:57,461
by getting me

571
00:21:57,461 --> 00:21:58,860
a more comfortable chair.

572
00:21:59,300 --> 00:22:00,860
My butt went numb waiting for you.

573
00:22:01,140 --> 00:22:01,820
Could it be

574
00:22:01,820 --> 00:22:02,941
that I did it on purpose

575
00:22:03,741 --> 00:22:04,620
so my clients

576
00:22:04,620 --> 00:22:05,941
don't get too comfortable

577
00:22:06,100 --> 00:22:06,901
and refuse to leave?

578
00:22:09,501 --> 00:22:10,461
Okay, down to business.

579
00:22:12,461 --> 00:22:13,701
We're just one spark away

580
00:22:14,901 --> 00:22:16,300
from catching them red-handed.

581
00:22:16,501 --> 00:22:17,340
Where do you plan

582
00:22:17,580 --> 00:22:18,461
to light that spark?

583
00:22:29,261 --> 00:22:29,860
Mr. Di.

584
00:22:32,580 --> 00:22:33,181
In a bit,

585
00:22:33,380 --> 00:22:34,300
go to the gallery

586
00:22:35,501 --> 00:22:36,380
and hand this check

587
00:22:36,540 --> 00:22:37,461
to Mr. Wang.

588
00:22:37,741 --> 00:22:38,100
Okay.

589
00:22:38,261 --> 00:22:39,060
I won't be going.

590
00:22:40,780 --> 00:22:41,380
Mr. Wang,

591
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:42,580
we should meet at the gallery.

592
00:22:42,580 --> 00:22:43,261
Why are you here?

593
00:22:43,421 --> 00:22:44,421
If I went to the gallery,

594
00:22:44,580 --> 00:22:46,540
could I meet Jiali's Mr. Di?

595
00:22:48,580 --> 00:22:49,701
This is for you.

596
00:22:56,340 --> 00:22:56,941
Mr. Di.

597
00:22:59,780 --> 00:23:00,340
Do you have

598
00:23:00,340 --> 00:23:01,421
anything else for me?

599
00:23:01,820 --> 00:23:02,860
Not much, really.

600
00:23:03,780 --> 00:23:04,901
I just want to meet

601
00:23:05,461 --> 00:23:06,501
the boss of Chuangyi.

602
00:23:08,140 --> 00:23:09,461
I don't know what you mean.

603
00:23:09,661 --> 00:23:10,461
Playing dumb now

604
00:23:10,580 --> 00:23:11,461
won't do you any good.

605
00:23:13,741 --> 00:23:14,860
Chuangyi is yours, right?

606
00:23:16,580 --> 00:23:17,181
Look.

607
00:23:17,941 --> 00:23:18,701
Give me

608
00:23:18,741 --> 00:23:20,100
another 1 million in compensation.

609
00:23:21,501 --> 00:23:22,100
Otherwise,

610
00:23:22,580 --> 00:23:23,340
you can imagine

611
00:23:23,780 --> 00:23:25,021
what scandal I'll stir up

612
00:23:25,461 --> 00:23:26,421
around your gallery.

613
00:23:27,380 --> 00:23:28,661
Use your imagination.

614
00:23:29,140 --> 00:23:30,701
You don't need to tell me this.

615
00:23:31,981 --> 00:23:32,981
Art transactions

616
00:23:32,981 --> 00:23:34,300
are voluntary.

617
00:23:34,981 --> 00:23:36,261
We operate legally.

618
00:23:36,941 --> 00:23:37,501
Employees

619
00:23:37,501 --> 00:23:38,981
might have abused their position,

620
00:23:39,461 --> 00:23:40,820
but it has nothing to do with me.

621
00:23:40,981 --> 00:23:42,140
Mr. Wang, your demand

622
00:23:42,140 --> 00:23:42,901
is unreasonable,

623
00:23:43,620 --> 00:23:45,300
and there is no legal basis for it.

624
00:23:46,701 --> 00:23:47,140
Fine.

625
00:23:47,421 --> 00:23:48,461
Go chat at your company.

626
00:23:49,501 --> 00:23:50,580
What? Trying to get rough?

627
00:23:51,060 --> 00:23:51,620
Calm down.

628
00:23:51,620 --> 00:23:52,140
What are you doing?

629
00:23:52,140 --> 00:23:52,992
I'm calling security!

630
00:23:55,661 --> 00:23:56,261
Security!

631
00:23:56,820 --> 00:23:57,421
Security!

632
00:23:57,780 --> 00:23:58,860
Someone's causing trouble!

633
00:23:58,860 --> 00:24:00,221
Hit me? Are you out of your mind?

634
00:24:05,340 --> 00:24:06,461
Don't actually hit him!

635
00:24:06,461 --> 00:24:07,860
Always causing trouble! Quick!

636
00:24:07,860 --> 00:24:08,649
What are you doing?

637
00:24:10,540 --> 00:24:11,140
Are you okay?

638
00:24:16,060 --> 00:24:17,021
Mr. Di, are you okay?

639
00:24:17,421 --> 00:24:18,021
I'm fine.

640
00:24:19,780 --> 00:24:20,741
Alright, stop looking.

641
00:24:22,300 --> 00:24:24,140
How can you say you're fine?

642
00:24:26,580 --> 00:24:28,100
There's so much we can do

643
00:24:28,100 --> 00:24:28,901
with this injury.

644
00:24:31,661 --> 00:24:33,100
Mr. Dong, what do you mean?

645
00:24:35,820 --> 00:24:36,261
Hold still.

646
00:24:43,701 --> 00:24:44,901
We retouch the photo,

647
00:24:45,501 --> 00:24:46,620
exaggerate the damage,

648
00:24:47,340 --> 00:24:48,701
and make it look

649
00:24:49,021 --> 00:24:50,741
like a severe trauma at first glance,

650
00:24:51,981 --> 00:24:53,620
like you're on the brink of death.

651
00:24:54,501 --> 00:24:55,620
Then we'll have someone

652
00:24:55,741 --> 00:24:56,901
write up an article,

653
00:24:57,620 --> 00:24:59,140
claiming our competitor

654
00:24:59,140 --> 00:25:00,100
tried to derail

655
00:25:00,100 --> 00:25:01,340
Jiali's new product launch

656
00:25:01,901 --> 00:25:03,100
by fabricating smear campaigns

657
00:25:03,100 --> 00:25:03,941
against us.

658
00:25:04,181 --> 00:25:05,300
Under these circumstances,

659
00:25:05,421 --> 00:25:06,461
a Jiali senior executive

660
00:25:06,501 --> 00:25:07,941
stepped up to confront them

661
00:25:08,340 --> 00:25:10,060
only to get beaten in broad daylight,

662
00:25:10,461 --> 00:25:11,620
and is now comatose,

663
00:25:12,060 --> 00:25:13,300
getting treatment in the ICU.

664
00:25:16,100 --> 00:25:17,580
That way, we can naturally

665
00:25:17,780 --> 00:25:19,300
cover up Jiali's recent scandals

666
00:25:19,300 --> 00:25:19,780
in the media

667
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:21,261
and win some sympathy.

668
00:25:22,100 --> 00:25:23,380
To pull this off,

669
00:25:23,741 --> 00:25:25,380
you'll have to stay in the hospital

670
00:25:25,421 --> 00:25:26,221
for a few more days.

671
00:25:28,968 --> 00:25:29,768
(Breaking News:
Jiali Executive beaten unconscious)

672
00:25:29,768 --> 00:25:30,440
(Jiali insider reveals clear source
behind recent scandals.)

673
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:31,176
(Our legal team has gathered evidence
of malicious rumors.)

674
00:25:31,176 --> 00:25:31,784
(Mr. Di only agreed to meet them
after repeated provocations)

675
00:25:31,784 --> 00:25:32,488
(to stop unfair competition in person,
never expecting a violent attack.)

676
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:36,232
Hold on a second.

677
00:25:39,221 --> 00:25:40,060
One short. No good.

678
00:25:40,060 --> 00:25:40,540
No.

679
00:25:41,300 --> 00:25:42,021
Did you see that?

680
00:25:42,021 --> 00:25:42,741
He saw your cards!

681
00:25:42,741 --> 00:25:43,404
Three of a kind.

682
00:25:44,860 --> 00:25:45,501
Three of a kind.

683
00:25:45,701 --> 00:25:47,021
She held them in front of me.

684
00:25:47,300 --> 00:25:48,100
No...

685
00:25:48,221 --> 00:25:48,981
I didn't.

686
00:25:49,032 --> 00:25:49,832
Not your turn yet.

687
00:25:53,672 --> 00:25:56,461
(Liren)

688
00:25:56,461 --> 00:25:57,060
Sorry,

689
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:59,421
the number you dialed is powered off.

690
00:25:59,661 --> 00:26:01,060
Please try again later.

691
00:26:10,340 --> 00:26:11,021
Sorry,

692
00:26:11,340 --> 00:26:13,380
(Liren)
the number you dialed is powered off.

693
00:26:13,501 --> 00:26:14,620
Please try again...

694
00:26:25,820 --> 00:26:27,181
Dinner's ready. Wash up and eat.

695
00:26:27,901 --> 00:26:28,421
Alright.

696
00:26:28,421 --> 00:26:28,981
Okay.

697
00:26:29,221 --> 00:26:30,060
Flip them over here.

698
00:26:30,060 --> 00:26:30,501
Okay.

699
00:26:30,780 --> 00:26:32,060
Taste our home cooking.

700
00:26:32,780 --> 00:26:33,380
Smells great.

701
00:26:33,661 --> 00:26:34,181
Come on.

702
00:26:34,501 --> 00:26:35,661
Have some soup first.

703
00:26:36,140 --> 00:26:36,661
Okay.

704
00:26:37,860 --> 00:26:38,620
Okay, enough.

705
00:26:38,620 --> 00:26:39,620
Liu Zi, give it to me.

706
00:26:39,780 --> 00:26:40,620
I'll do it myself.

707
00:26:40,620 --> 00:26:41,701
Alright, help yourself.

708
00:26:44,060 --> 00:26:45,300
Quite a feast today.

709
00:26:45,380 --> 00:26:46,340
Yeah, we have shrimp.

710
00:26:46,580 --> 00:26:47,060
Okay.

711
00:26:49,860 --> 00:26:50,340
Mr. Yu,

712
00:26:50,340 --> 00:26:51,181
may I take a day off?

713
00:26:51,580 --> 00:26:52,181
I just noticed

714
00:26:52,261 --> 00:26:53,580
the Rasagiline pills in the box

715
00:26:53,661 --> 00:26:54,461
got a bit damp.

716
00:26:54,701 --> 00:26:55,741
I want to go to the clinic

717
00:26:55,741 --> 00:26:56,661
to get you a refill,

718
00:26:57,181 --> 00:26:58,100
so they work right.

719
00:26:58,261 --> 00:26:58,941
Sure.

720
00:26:59,661 --> 00:27:00,901
You're always so thoughtful.

721
00:27:01,021 --> 00:27:02,140
Hurry back, then.

722
00:27:02,140 --> 00:27:02,860
Will do.

723
00:27:03,221 --> 00:27:04,021
Enjoy your meal.

724
00:27:04,021 --> 00:27:04,620
Okay.

725
00:27:04,741 --> 00:27:05,580
Thanks, Ms. Hui.

726
00:27:06,888 --> 00:27:10,920
(Outpatient)

727
00:27:14,860 --> 00:27:15,780
Stop watching.

728
00:27:16,501 --> 00:27:17,540
He's putting on an act.

729
00:27:18,181 --> 00:27:18,901
Still, he was once

730
00:27:18,941 --> 00:27:20,021
the man you slept with.

731
00:27:20,261 --> 00:27:21,380
Don't you feel any sympathy?

732
00:27:21,964 --> 00:27:22,701
Aren't you afraid

733
00:27:22,701 --> 00:27:23,820
the people you sent

734
00:27:23,981 --> 00:27:25,021
might've hit him so hard

735
00:27:25,140 --> 00:27:26,004
he got hospitalized?

736
00:27:26,140 --> 00:27:27,221
I only encouraged them

737
00:27:27,221 --> 00:27:28,380
to fight for their right

738
00:27:28,380 --> 00:27:29,661
to return their purchases.

739
00:27:30,380 --> 00:27:32,261
I never hired anyone to beat him up.

740
00:27:32,780 --> 00:27:34,221
That just proves Di Liren

741
00:27:34,221 --> 00:27:35,620
has one of those punchable faces.

742
00:27:38,021 --> 00:27:38,661
By the way,

743
00:27:39,421 --> 00:27:40,421
that Mr. Dong

744
00:27:40,901 --> 00:27:41,901
won't mess up, right?

745
00:27:42,540 --> 00:27:43,221
Of course.

746
00:27:43,661 --> 00:27:44,701
Even though Mr. Dong

747
00:27:44,701 --> 00:27:46,060
doesn't know what I'm up to,

748
00:27:46,221 --> 00:27:47,860
he'll always side with me

749
00:27:48,100 --> 00:27:49,060
over Liren.

750
00:27:49,540 --> 00:27:51,461
You're going all out with the outfit?

751
00:27:51,901 --> 00:27:52,820
Of course.

752
00:27:53,100 --> 00:27:54,380
For such a big occasion,

753
00:27:54,501 --> 00:27:56,021
I need a full face of makeup

754
00:27:56,300 --> 00:27:57,100
to hold the fort.

755
00:27:58,741 --> 00:27:59,380
Alright.

756
00:28:00,620 --> 00:28:01,380
(Outpatient)
Don't worry.

757
00:28:01,540 --> 00:28:03,021
I've handled everything else.

758
00:28:03,421 --> 00:28:04,261
I already had Liu Zi

759
00:28:04,261 --> 00:28:05,060
play cards

760
00:28:05,060 --> 00:28:06,261
with my parents,

761
00:28:06,540 --> 00:28:07,620
so they won't use phones.

762
00:28:09,140 --> 00:28:10,860
I'm terrified my dad might see this

763
00:28:11,221 --> 00:28:12,181
and get angina again.

764
00:28:13,461 --> 00:28:14,461
Very thorough.

765
00:28:15,340 --> 00:28:16,780
Out of all my cases,

766
00:28:16,820 --> 00:28:18,261
you snap out of it the fastest.

767
00:28:22,701 --> 00:28:24,100
Isn't that eyeliner

768
00:28:24,580 --> 00:28:25,901
winged out a bit too much?

769
00:28:29,100 --> 00:28:29,661
Isn't it nice?

770
00:28:31,860 --> 00:28:32,901
You look intimidating.

771
00:28:33,540 --> 00:28:34,421
That's right.

772
00:28:35,140 --> 00:28:36,701
A true boss lady's wings

773
00:28:36,860 --> 00:28:38,221
always reach for the sky.

774
00:28:38,501 --> 00:28:39,300
That's great.

775
00:28:39,340 --> 00:28:40,221
No need to take a cab.

776
00:28:40,340 --> 00:28:41,701
You can reach far for free.

777
00:28:42,461 --> 00:28:43,461
I can give you a kick

778
00:28:43,461 --> 00:28:44,780
for a free ride too.

779
00:28:46,181 --> 00:28:47,941
I'd feel a bit embarrassed.

780
00:28:48,060 --> 00:28:49,140
The firm reimburses

781
00:28:49,140 --> 00:28:50,021
our cab fares anyway.

782
00:28:50,140 --> 00:28:51,421
I can't just take this for free.

783
00:28:54,060 --> 00:28:55,701
Oh, I'd gladly take it.

784
00:28:56,421 --> 00:28:57,941
Since you don't want freebies,

785
00:28:57,941 --> 00:28:59,060
hand over

786
00:28:59,060 --> 00:28:59,941
that insurance claim

787
00:28:59,981 --> 00:29:01,060
from when you scratched

788
00:29:01,140 --> 00:29:01,780
my car.

789
00:29:02,021 --> 00:29:03,021
Now I see

790
00:29:03,060 --> 00:29:04,340
why your streams are so popular.

791
00:29:04,461 --> 00:29:05,380
Such a massive market

792
00:29:05,501 --> 00:29:06,380
for masochists.

793
00:29:07,261 --> 00:29:08,140
Two... No.

794
00:29:08,300 --> 00:29:09,701
I mean, Ms. Yu.

795
00:29:10,340 --> 00:29:11,860
So we're just gonna wait here

796
00:29:12,421 --> 00:29:13,140
for them to come?

797
00:29:13,421 --> 00:29:14,021
She could

798
00:29:14,021 --> 00:29:15,380
cancel Di Liren's deposit

799
00:29:15,380 --> 00:29:17,021
at a moment's notice.

800
00:29:17,261 --> 00:29:18,901
That shows their financial ties

801
00:29:19,060 --> 00:29:20,501
run far deeper

802
00:29:20,501 --> 00:29:21,221
than we thought.

803
00:29:21,661 --> 00:29:23,221
Regardless of feelings, just for money,

804
00:29:23,421 --> 00:29:24,620
she'll come check if Liren

805
00:29:24,620 --> 00:29:25,461
is dead or alive.

806
00:29:25,741 --> 00:29:27,060
In a crowd this big,

807
00:29:27,100 --> 00:29:28,540
how do we know who she is

808
00:29:28,741 --> 00:29:29,620
or if she even came?

809
00:29:36,701 --> 00:29:37,221
Finger heart?

810
00:29:37,901 --> 00:29:39,380
Heart my foot.

811
00:29:39,620 --> 00:29:41,860
I mean I've got this in the bag.

812
00:29:42,941 --> 00:29:43,820
I already had Mr. Dong

813
00:29:43,820 --> 00:29:44,820
set up the caregiver.

814
00:29:45,060 --> 00:29:45,901
If anyone visits,

815
00:29:46,140 --> 00:29:47,221
he'll notify me right away.

816
00:30:22,300 --> 00:30:22,941
Mr. Di.

817
00:30:28,421 --> 00:30:29,421
What are you doing here?

818
00:30:31,661 --> 00:30:32,540
Are you hurt badly?

819
00:30:33,661 --> 00:30:34,741
Just minor scratches.

820
00:30:35,741 --> 00:30:36,540
Why?

821
00:30:38,221 --> 00:30:39,021
I'm hospitalized.

822
00:30:39,580 --> 00:30:40,820
Yu Meng has to show up, right?

823
00:30:41,540 --> 00:30:42,780
When I heard the door earlier,

824
00:30:42,901 --> 00:30:43,941
I thought it was her.

825
00:30:44,140 --> 00:30:45,221
I didn't expect you.

826
00:30:45,820 --> 00:30:46,860
I called you.

827
00:30:47,620 --> 00:30:48,372
You didn't answer.

828
00:30:48,580 --> 00:30:49,540
My phone broke.

829
00:30:51,375 --> 00:30:52,380
What about her parents?

830
00:30:52,380 --> 00:30:53,267
Why haven't they come?

831
00:30:55,741 --> 00:30:57,060
Liu Zi came over today

832
00:30:57,580 --> 00:30:58,780
to play cards with them.

833
00:30:59,340 --> 00:31:00,380
Phones untouched all day.

834
00:31:00,461 --> 00:31:01,661
They don't know you're hurt.

835
00:31:06,221 --> 00:31:07,060
Something's off.

836
00:31:10,100 --> 00:31:10,941
You should head back.

837
00:31:11,901 --> 00:31:13,140
You shouldn't be here.

838
00:31:14,181 --> 00:31:15,221
Don't worry.

839
00:31:16,140 --> 00:31:17,580
Without an ironclad excuse,

840
00:31:18,300 --> 00:31:19,901
I wouldn't risk coming here.

841
00:31:33,981 --> 00:31:35,181
You're worried about me?

842
00:31:42,701 --> 00:31:43,941
These calluses on your hands

843
00:31:44,421 --> 00:31:45,461
are getting thicker.

844
00:31:45,860 --> 00:31:46,461
Yeah.

845
00:31:47,901 --> 00:31:49,100
If you really died,

846
00:31:50,340 --> 00:31:51,620
my last few years'd be wasted.

847
00:31:54,021 --> 00:31:55,300
Don't talk nonsense.

848
00:31:59,976 --> 00:32:02,536
♪I've seen this game before♪

849
00:32:03,100 --> 00:32:04,421
(A female visitor came.)

850
00:32:05,256 --> 00:32:07,592
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

851
00:32:08,040 --> 00:32:10,824
♪Just an empty shell♪

852
00:32:11,112 --> 00:32:13,896
♪I've broken this game before♪

853
00:32:13,896 --> 00:32:16,296
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

854
00:32:16,296 --> 00:32:18,504
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

855
00:32:18,632 --> 00:32:23,240
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

856
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,228
(A female visitor came.)

857
00:32:26,184 --> 00:32:28,968
♪For the part you owe me♪

858
00:32:28,968 --> 00:32:34,888
♪I'll make you pay double♪

859
00:32:37,140 --> 00:32:37,941
Meng,

860
00:32:38,701 --> 00:32:39,701
you're finally back!

861
00:32:39,981 --> 00:32:41,021
Your parents were worried.

862
00:32:41,100 --> 00:32:42,261
They looked everywhere.

863
00:32:44,100 --> 00:32:44,860
This is Ms. Hui,

864
00:32:45,421 --> 00:32:46,501
my parents' housekeeper.

865
00:32:47,461 --> 00:32:48,181
This is Liu Bai.

866
00:32:51,181 --> 00:32:51,780
Hello.

867
00:32:52,261 --> 00:32:52,820
Hello.

868
00:32:52,981 --> 00:32:53,501
Ms. Hui,

869
00:32:54,100 --> 00:32:54,981
what brings you here?

870
00:32:56,540 --> 00:32:57,501
I came to pick up

871
00:32:58,380 --> 00:32:59,060
(Rasagiline Mesylate Tablets)
two boxes of pills for your dad.

872
00:32:59,661 --> 00:33:01,060
His old ones got damp.

873
00:33:01,421 --> 00:33:02,421
I bumped into Zhang Tao

874
00:33:02,500 --> 00:33:03,622
getting medicine for Mr. Di,

875
00:33:03,780 --> 00:33:04,661
so I came visit him.

876
00:33:07,340 --> 00:33:07,981
Honey,

877
00:33:08,380 --> 00:33:09,221
I'm hurt.

878
00:33:09,981 --> 00:33:10,421
Come on.

879
00:33:10,741 --> 00:33:11,620
Let's talk outside.

880
00:33:16,340 --> 00:33:17,181
Why are you here too?

881
00:33:17,701 --> 00:33:19,248
My sister's afraid you'd get bullied.

882
00:33:27,701 --> 00:33:28,261
Ms. Hui,

883
00:33:28,820 --> 00:33:30,580
while you were here,

884
00:33:30,941 --> 00:33:31,701
did anyone else

885
00:33:31,701 --> 00:33:32,461
come visit him?

886
00:33:32,860 --> 00:33:34,261
A nurse checked his blood pressure.

887
00:33:34,981 --> 00:33:36,941
Besides nurses or doctors,

888
00:33:37,060 --> 00:33:38,100
no one else?

889
00:33:38,941 --> 00:33:39,620
No.

890
00:33:41,461 --> 00:33:43,140
How long were you inside?

891
00:33:43,540 --> 00:33:45,021
In the half hour I was there,

892
00:33:45,741 --> 00:33:47,021
no one else walked in.

893
00:33:47,701 --> 00:33:48,741
Is something wrong?

894
00:33:49,620 --> 00:33:50,181
Nothing.

895
00:33:50,860 --> 00:33:51,661
The aide talked

896
00:33:51,661 --> 00:33:52,421
to the nurse.

897
00:33:52,620 --> 00:33:53,380
No strangers.

898
00:33:53,540 --> 00:33:54,221
Don't worry.

899
00:33:55,380 --> 00:33:56,780
Be careful on your way

900
00:33:56,780 --> 00:33:57,300
home.

901
00:33:57,340 --> 00:33:57,661
Okay.

902
00:33:57,981 --> 00:33:58,701
I'll be going now.

903
00:33:58,901 --> 00:33:59,300
Bye-bye.

904
00:33:59,461 --> 00:33:59,941
Bye-bye.

905
00:34:06,820 --> 00:34:07,461
Can you take

906
00:34:07,461 --> 00:34:08,540
both of them on alone?

907
00:34:08,740 --> 00:34:09,501
(Jiao Xu)
I'll go help you.

908
00:34:10,060 --> 00:34:11,381
Don't worry. No extra charge.

909
00:34:13,740 --> 00:34:14,301
Wrong person.

910
00:34:14,781 --> 00:34:15,341
Missed.

911
00:34:29,461 --> 00:34:30,461
Honey,

912
00:34:30,660 --> 00:34:32,060
I feel so dizzy.

913
00:34:32,421 --> 00:34:34,220
Where I was hit hurts so bad.

914
00:34:35,501 --> 00:34:36,461
It's so serious.

915
00:34:37,180 --> 00:34:38,180
Could it be a concussion

916
00:34:38,180 --> 00:34:39,060
and you're dying?

917
00:34:39,580 --> 00:34:40,540
I'll go get the nurse.

918
00:34:42,260 --> 00:34:43,060
Honey,

919
00:34:43,620 --> 00:34:45,140
it's not actually that bad.

920
00:34:45,540 --> 00:34:46,220
Look.

921
00:34:46,781 --> 00:34:48,180
It's a glucose drip.

922
00:34:48,301 --> 00:34:49,060
If not that bad,

923
00:34:49,060 --> 00:34:49,901
why make

924
00:34:49,901 --> 00:34:50,501
such a fuss?

925
00:34:50,660 --> 00:34:51,700
My parents would freak out

926
00:34:51,700 --> 00:34:52,603
if they saw the news.

927
00:34:54,421 --> 00:34:55,060
Sit down.

928
00:34:57,100 --> 00:34:58,381
It was Mr. Dong's idea.

929
00:34:58,861 --> 00:34:59,941
I thought it made sense.

930
00:35:00,381 --> 00:35:01,021
First,

931
00:35:01,461 --> 00:35:03,381
it eases public pressure on the company

932
00:35:03,700 --> 00:35:04,861
by shifting the focus

933
00:35:05,100 --> 00:35:06,540
to corporate rivalry.

934
00:35:07,501 --> 00:35:08,220
Second,

935
00:35:08,941 --> 00:35:10,461
I knew you were mad at me

936
00:35:10,580 --> 00:35:11,580
and vanished on purpose.

937
00:35:12,060 --> 00:35:12,941
I had to see you

938
00:35:13,060 --> 00:35:14,501
to apologize properly, right?

939
00:35:14,941 --> 00:35:16,620
So you banked on me showing up.

940
00:35:18,580 --> 00:35:19,421
Honey,

941
00:35:20,540 --> 00:35:21,821
where did you go?

942
00:35:22,461 --> 00:35:23,100
Mr. Di.

943
00:35:23,821 --> 00:35:24,740
- Mr. Di.
- Mr. Di.

944
00:35:24,821 --> 00:35:25,540
We're here!

945
00:35:25,620 --> 00:35:26,140
They insisted

946
00:35:26,301 --> 00:35:27,059
on visiting you.

947
00:35:27,180 --> 00:35:28,100
Heard your phone broke,

948
00:35:28,381 --> 00:35:29,421
so we brought you a spare.

949
00:35:29,901 --> 00:35:30,700
Mrs. Di is here!

950
00:35:31,140 --> 00:35:32,180
- Hello, Mrs. Di.
- Hello, Mrs. Di.

951
00:35:32,421 --> 00:35:33,100
That wasn't easy.

952
00:35:33,381 --> 00:35:33,821
Mr. Di,

953
00:35:33,981 --> 00:35:34,660
you finally

954
00:35:34,700 --> 00:35:35,260
won her back!

955
00:35:35,461 --> 00:35:36,861
We brought a fruit basket.

956
00:35:37,140 --> 00:35:37,580
Mrs. Di,

957
00:35:37,740 --> 00:35:39,660
make Mr. Di kneel on a durian

958
00:35:39,781 --> 00:35:40,501
to show sincerity.

959
00:35:40,501 --> 00:35:41,580
Mr. Di's injured already!

960
00:35:41,620 --> 00:35:42,421
You let them come?

961
00:35:42,540 --> 00:35:44,021
They were worried about you.

962
00:35:44,301 --> 00:35:45,060
Just a scrape.

963
00:35:45,421 --> 00:35:46,021
It's nothing.

964
00:35:46,381 --> 00:35:47,140
Then I'll do

965
00:35:47,140 --> 00:35:47,981
a brief report.

966
00:35:48,660 --> 00:35:49,301
Mrs. Di,

967
00:35:49,540 --> 00:35:50,620
- Mr. Di has had it rough
- Yeah, please forgive him.

968
00:35:50,620 --> 00:35:51,580
- these days.
- Exactly.

969
00:35:51,781 --> 00:35:52,861
Please forgive him.

970
00:35:53,021 --> 00:35:54,341
Alright, quiet down.

971
00:35:55,821 --> 00:35:56,580
Keep this up,

972
00:35:56,901 --> 00:35:58,140
and she will get mad again.

973
00:36:01,821 --> 00:36:02,540
Honey,

974
00:36:02,981 --> 00:36:03,861
I'm so sorry.

975
00:36:05,301 --> 00:36:06,861
This time, I truly realize

976
00:36:06,861 --> 00:36:07,660
where I went wrong.

977
00:36:07,941 --> 00:36:08,821
It's my fault.

978
00:36:09,220 --> 00:36:10,180
I shouldn't have drunk,

979
00:36:11,341 --> 00:36:12,540
nor should I have assumed

980
00:36:12,540 --> 00:36:13,381
you were at the inn

981
00:36:13,981 --> 00:36:15,501
instead of looking for you right away.

982
00:36:16,341 --> 00:36:16,941
All my fault.

983
00:36:18,660 --> 00:36:19,941
Give me one more chance,

984
00:36:20,220 --> 00:36:21,461
and I'll make it right.

985
00:36:36,740 --> 00:36:37,461
You're back.

986
00:36:40,941 --> 00:36:41,861
Where are my parents?

987
00:36:42,341 --> 00:36:43,140
Downstairs.

988
00:36:43,660 --> 00:36:45,060
They saw the news

989
00:36:45,260 --> 00:36:46,421
and worried you got kidnapped

990
00:36:46,501 --> 00:36:47,341
over a corporate war.

991
00:36:47,381 --> 00:36:48,341
Have they been watching

992
00:36:48,540 --> 00:36:49,260
some soap operas

993
00:36:49,260 --> 00:36:50,060
lately?

994
00:36:50,220 --> 00:36:50,740
I don't know.

995
00:36:51,381 --> 00:36:52,580
Di Liren called them to say

996
00:36:52,660 --> 00:36:53,260
he was fine,

997
00:36:53,381 --> 00:36:54,580
so they finally relaxed.

998
00:36:56,781 --> 00:36:58,501
He wasn't letting them know he's safe.

999
00:36:58,861 --> 00:37:00,421
He tried to keep his good-guy image.

1000
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:02,341
To my parents,

1001
00:37:02,381 --> 00:37:03,220
he's a good man,

1002
00:37:03,540 --> 00:37:04,501
and I'm

1003
00:37:04,580 --> 00:37:05,140
unreasonable.

1004
00:37:05,901 --> 00:37:06,540
Meng!

1005
00:37:07,580 --> 00:37:08,220
- Meng!
- Meng,

1006
00:37:08,421 --> 00:37:10,180
you finally decided to come home!

1007
00:37:10,501 --> 00:37:11,501
You didn't answer calls

1008
00:37:11,620 --> 00:37:12,620
or texts.

1009
00:37:12,821 --> 00:37:13,901
We were worried sick!

1010
00:37:14,501 --> 00:37:15,301
Thank goodness

1011
00:37:15,341 --> 00:37:16,781
Liren called us ahead of time.

1012
00:37:17,021 --> 00:37:18,421
He's hospitalized, you're missing.

1013
00:37:18,620 --> 00:37:19,781
What were we supposed to do?

1014
00:37:20,781 --> 00:37:22,180
What's wrong with you?

1015
00:37:24,700 --> 00:37:26,100
I will forgive you just this once.

1016
00:37:28,021 --> 00:37:29,660
No matter what happens,

1017
00:37:29,740 --> 00:37:30,901
you can't just leave

1018
00:37:31,060 --> 00:37:32,060
without a word.

1019
00:37:34,620 --> 00:37:36,301
Talk to me when things go wrong.

1020
00:37:36,501 --> 00:37:37,740
I will handle it for you.

1021
00:37:38,861 --> 00:37:41,021
I know, Dad.

1022
00:37:41,461 --> 00:37:42,700
I know, Mom.

1023
00:37:42,901 --> 00:37:44,580
I'll tell you everything from now on.

1024
00:37:46,941 --> 00:37:48,220
It's good to be home.

1025
00:37:49,021 --> 00:37:50,021
You scared us to death.

1026
00:37:50,540 --> 00:37:51,821
Don't run off like that again.

1027
00:37:52,301 --> 00:37:53,260
We worried sick.

1028
00:37:56,781 --> 00:37:58,620
Are you still planning to tell

1029
00:37:58,861 --> 00:37:59,341
your parents

1030
00:37:59,381 --> 00:38:00,580
