1031
00:38:01,341 --> 00:38:02,021
Shameless fool!

1032
00:38:02,381 --> 00:38:03,861
Definitely divorcing him!

1033
00:38:10,781 --> 00:38:11,981
I'll hold off for now.

1034
00:38:12,981 --> 00:38:14,021
I saw the preview.

1035
00:38:15,260 --> 00:38:16,100
He has more than one.

1036
00:38:16,660 --> 00:38:16,981
He has

1037
00:38:17,021 --> 00:38:18,180
several other women outside.

1038
00:38:20,341 --> 00:38:21,220
Yeah.

1039
00:38:21,941 --> 00:38:22,821
Quite a few.

1040
00:38:22,941 --> 00:38:24,021
Why not just divorce?

1041
00:38:27,861 --> 00:38:28,821
Getting divorce

1042
00:38:29,260 --> 00:38:30,461
