1043
00:38:31,060 --> 00:38:32,580
There are a lot of issues to solve.

1044
00:38:32,861 --> 00:38:33,901
She'll soon find out

1045
00:38:34,501 --> 00:38:35,700
her husband has been secretly

1046
00:38:35,901 --> 00:38:36,821
transferring assets.

1047
00:38:40,620 --> 00:38:41,518
What a coincidence...

1048
00:38:45,100 --> 00:38:47,220
So quiet and sneaky?

1049
00:38:47,700 --> 00:38:49,260
How did he transfer them?

1050
00:38:49,660 --> 00:38:50,861
Her husband had a first love.

1051
00:38:51,260 --> 00:38:52,781
Things didn't work out back then.

1052
00:38:53,421 --> 00:38:53,981
Later on,

1053
00:38:54,060 --> 00:38:55,301
