Hello, Mr. Di.

1072
00:39:33,381 --> 00:39:34,381
What can I help you with?

1073
00:39:34,620 --> 00:39:35,341
You know me?

1074
00:39:35,700 --> 00:39:37,060
Besides Dong Jun, who else

1075
00:39:37,540 --> 00:39:38,781
